Bloodied Lakṣmaṇa rejoices slaying Indra conqueror --- Lakṣmaṇa leads Jāmbavān Hanumān hosts leaning on Vibhīṣaṇa Hanumān --- Lakṣmaṇa salutes Rāma standing like Upēndra reporting slaughter --- Delighted Vibhīṣaṇa announces severed head to Rāma --- Rāma seats Lakṣmaṇa on lap embraces smells head consoling --- Rāma praises foeless feat and vows to slay sallying Rāvaṇa --- Rāma declares Sītā and earth won through Lakṣmaṇa protector --- Rāma bids Suṣēṇa swiftly heal darted Lakṣmaṇa Vibhīṣaṇa and wounded monkeys --- Suṣēṇa herb scent heals Lakṣmaṇa then treats Vibhīṣaṇa and monkey chiefs --- Rāma Sugrīva Vibhīṣaṇa Jāmbavān rejoice seeing Lakṣmaṇa well
